  "title": "Restoranda buyurtma",
  "title_de": "Im Restaurant",
  "goal": "Dars oxirida restoranda \"Ich möchte ...\" bilan ichimlik va taom buyurtma qilasiz, menyu va hisobni so'raysiz hamda \"Zusammen oder getrennt?\" savoliga javob bera olasiz.",
  "skill_focus": [
    "speaking",
    "listening",
    "grammar"
  ],
  "explanation": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Restoranda eng kerakli fe'l — möchten (xohlamoq). U muloyim shakl: \"Ich möchte einen Tee\" — \"Men bitta choy xohlardim\". \"Ich will\" (xohlayman) restoranda qo'pol eshitiladi."
    },
    {
